  (text "BAT2 channel: 1 mOhm Kelvin shunt, INA241A2 (20 V/V, REF=Vs/2 -> bidirectional, +-82 A FS),\nback-to-back P-FET switch. Gate driver sinks ~2 mA via MMBTA42, 12 V zener sets Vgs independent\nof bus voltage (10S..20S)."
